 HISTORY                                                          8147 1451
 -------                                                          8147 1451
    This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction       8147 1451
    Physics (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. 8147 1451
    The thermal scattering law data for Uranium in Uranium        8147 1451
    Carbide was developed using ab initio lattice dynamics        8147 1451
    (AILD)[1,2]. Ten temperatures are available in this library.  8147 1451
    The Full Law Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) system   8147 1451
    was used to produce File 7 MT = 2, 4 data for Uranium in UC   8147 1451
    [3]. MAT=8147 and ZA=8247 are used for U in UC (100%          8147 1451
    enriched). Elemental AWR and cross sections were computed     8147 1451
    from ENDF/B-VIII.0 MF=3 MT=2 nuclide evaluations [4] at 1e-5eV8147 1451
    with C-12 updated to reflect a mass of exactly 12 amu.        8147 1451
